# 7. Structured Windows Troubleshooting Workflow

```text
Gather Information
        ↓
Identify Symptoms and Scope
        ↓
Assess Data and Security Risks
        ↓
Investigate Possible Causes
        ↓
Select an Appropriate Recovery Option
        ↓
Obtain Authorization When Required
        ↓
Apply the Approved Action
        ↓
Verify Windows and Data
        ↓
Document the Outcome
        ↓
Close or Escalate
```

### Important Help Desk Principle

Do not immediately reset, reinstall, or make major system changes.

First gather evidence, protect user data, choose an appropriate recovery method, and confirm that the action is authorized.

