# ⭐ Key Takeaways

- Backups protect data and support recovery.
- System Restore rolls back certain Windows system changes.
- WinRE provides access to Windows recovery tools.
- Startup Repair addresses certain startup problems.
- Safe Mode helps troubleshoot issues involving drivers, applications, or services.
- Resetting Windows can affect applications, settings, and data.
- Always assess data risk and backup availability before potentially destructive recovery actions.
- Verify the result and document the outcome.
- Escalate when the issue exceeds your authorization or requires specialist expertise.

